        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Select a passage from a major work in your field. Work with a partner to analyze its professional voice. What sorts of characters does it use? What is the balance between active and passive verbs? How are nominalizations used? How, and how extensively, does it use metadiscourse? Try to distinguish traits specific to this work from those that characterize the field's professional voice. Now, revise a passage of your own writing so that it imitates that voice. What did you have to change?",
            "block_bbox": [
                127,
                435,
                783,
                580
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
